Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.40,0:00:07.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)}The radiance of the night shines through my window
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.17,0:00:11.12,Opening,,0,0,0,,but the path to immortality is long.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.60,0:00:15.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.85,0:00:21.01,Opening,,0,0,0,,Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:25.00,Opening,,0,0,0,,Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.40,0:00:28.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.25,0:00:33.52,Opening,,0,0,0,,The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:37.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.84,0:00:40.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,as the storm rages just below.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.88,0:00:44.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.85,0:00:47.84,Opening,,0,0,0,,I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:50.69,Opening,,0,0,0,,why the world is a-changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.71,0:00:54.04,Opening,,0,0,0,,Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.28,0:00:57.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:01:00.29,Opening,,0,0,0,,experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.45,0:01:03.17,Opening,,0,0,0,,I will defy the light in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.61,Opening,,0,0,0,,to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:19.05,Opening,,0,0,0,,Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:22.13,Opening,,0,0,0,,Transform your insignificant body into light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.29,0:01:25.25,Opening,,0,0,0,,The hardships of the journey
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.37,0:01:28.21,Opening,,0,0,0,,will temper this young man's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.21,0:01:32.85,Opening,,0,0,0,,If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:43.48,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.91,0:02:01.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,The teleportation formation 40 000 li east of here
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.80,0:02:03.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,leads directly to Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.68,0:02:17.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's no god statue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:19.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything changes one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.00,0:02:21.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's just a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:27.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,There's a shabby temple here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.12,0:02:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's sleep here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.92,0:02:29.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.84,0:02:30.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just for one night then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.60,0:02:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,My god,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:33.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,this damn weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,The monks of this temple are all gone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.28,0:02:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,but the mortals disturbed its tranquility.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.33,0:02:48.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Doesn't fellow cultivator feel they broke the mood of this rainy night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.40,0:02:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This person saw through me at a glance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.92,0:02:53.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I cannot see through his cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:55.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,He isn't simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.92,0:02:58.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't be so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.96,0:03:00.06,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1427,435)}Mo Zhi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.72,0:02:59.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,My name is Mo Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.92,0:03:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.40,0:03:03.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone from the mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.56,0:03:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't have a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.20,0:03:06.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Call me Ceng Niu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.72,0:03:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.17,0:03:14.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why don't the two of us sit down and talk about the Dao on this rainy night ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:16.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not a bad idea, right ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.28,0:03:18.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What do you think ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.08,0:03:25.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu's cultivation is shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:28.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I'm not seeing wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.92,0:03:31.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're close to obtaining your domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:33.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,you have the right state of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.28,0:03:40.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,What in the world are you two talking about ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.72,0:03:42.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you guys crazy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.49,0:03:45.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sir, what you said is right !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your use of the word "crazy" is excellent !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,If one isn't crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:53.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,why would they try to understand the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,If one isn't crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.88,0:03:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,why would they try to become an Immortal ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.96,0:03:59.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,One must want something
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:00.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,in order to obtain it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:02.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's the truth of the world !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.92,0:04:05.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't understand a single word,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.36,0:04:06.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,he really is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does Brother Ceng understand ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.16,0:04:12.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your words are too mysterious.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:14.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.48,0:04:17.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I think the word "crazy" is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Instead, the word "obsessive" is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.20,0:04:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wonderful !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.08,0:04:26.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,If us cultivators weren't obsessive
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.16,0:04:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,then how could we go down the right path
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.24,0:04:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,to understand the law of the heavens ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:39.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.48,0:04:41.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,where were... we at ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,He really is crazy !
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.88,0:04:46.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's it,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:48.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,he's insane, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.52,0:04:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are all sorts of people, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Well, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.80,0:04:54.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,My name is Mo Zhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.40,0:04:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,How should I call you ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.00,0:04:59.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ceng Niu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.08,0:05:01.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,The mood of this rainy night
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.88,0:05:03.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,is endlessly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:06.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,The plants silently absorb the humidity
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.68,0:05:09.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the scent of death on them quietly disappears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:11.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is the beauty of the rain and the taste of Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,What does Brother Mo think Life is ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mortals often say that
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.52,0:05:18.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life is a fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.92,0:05:21.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,So maybe this fire here
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.20,0:05:23.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,is Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.88,0:05:24.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Then
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is Death ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.04,0:05:30.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know how Brother is called.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.32,0:05:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,His name is Ceng Niu !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.24,0:05:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,How many time has he said that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.96,0:05:33.48,Second,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.88,0:05:35.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even I remember what they said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.60,0:05:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ever since I obtained my domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.16,0:05:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,my memory has been a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu, forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:43.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,May I ask
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,what kind of domain Brother understood ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since Brother Mo is showing me his domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:03.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,aren't you afraid I would try to steal it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,You pursue a way higher domain,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.52,0:06:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I doubt my lowly Forget Domain can move you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.96,0:06:12.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Mo is being modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.72,0:06:13.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,This domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.80,0:06:14.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,is above average.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although my domain is above average,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.20,0:06:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,there are higher levels of domains.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,There are only 2 ways to obtain a domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.24,0:06:26.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,The first one is to imitate the domain of another,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.04,0:06:30.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,the second is to comprehend the heavens to form your own domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.04,0:06:34.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Although both methods will achieve Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,the difference in realms is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:40.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Whether it's in power or potential,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.88,0:06:42.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,the first method is inferior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:46.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But cultivators who can understand their own domain
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.20,0:06:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,are very rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.40,0:06:50.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,To reach Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.08,0:06:53.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,imitating is the common way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.32,0:06:55.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But you are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.88,0:06:57.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.20,0:06:59.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will achieve great things in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.08,0:07:05.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,You haven't answered what Death is yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.37,0:07:06.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,please continue !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:06.96,Second,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's Death...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.96,0:07:08.60,Second,,0,0,0,,it was getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.72,0:07:10.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death is to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.01,0:07:12.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a person dies, it is Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the heart dies, it forgets.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.12,0:07:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.41,0:07:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Death is a state of forgetfulness.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:24.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,If a person dies, it is Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:28.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the heart dies, then it forgets…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:35.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The water falling in this puddle today
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,makes the puddle come to Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.39,0:07:41.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, when the rain will be over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.47,0:07:45.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,this puddle will become Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,This temple was alive
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.32,0:07:50.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,when there was a god statue here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:52.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that it's gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.84,0:07:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,it is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.28,0:07:58.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,On this rainy night
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:00.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't look at the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.68,0:08:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.32,0:08:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,or the rain itself
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.04,0:08:08.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,but at the raindrop's entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,Brother Ceng Niu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.44,0:08:12.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,either you understand
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.52,0:08:15.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,or you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.04,0:08:18.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.68,0:08:25.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fire lights up then vanishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:29.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,Rains comes and falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.80,0:08:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Everything in this world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,experiences Life and Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.77,0:08:40.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about Life and Death for decades
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:43.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I just realized now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.40,0:08:47.92,Rain,,0,0,0,,{\pos(401,315)\frz90.0\fad(300,000)}A raindrop is born in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.40,0:08:47.92,Rain,,0,0,0,,{\pos(733,507)\frz90.0\fad(300,000)}and dies on the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.44,0:08:46.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,that a raindrop is born in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,and dies on the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.28,0:08:50.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,The process of falling in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.44,0:08:51.92,Rain,,0,0,0,,{\pos(393,425)\frz90.0\fad(300,000)}The process of falling in the middle
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.64,0:08:51.92,Rain,,0,0,0,,{\pos(685,562)\frz90.0\fad(300,000)}is its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.16,0:08:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,is its life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:53.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is Life and Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.93,0:08:57.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,A realm that belongs to me, Wang Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.97,0:08:59.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Life and Death Domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.08,0:09:10.29,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1396,445)\fad(500,500}Country of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:18.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,The last time I was here,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,I reached the 15th layer of Qi Condensation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.72,0:09:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.44,0:09:25.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will reach Soul Formation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:38.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,My avatar has reached peak Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,but because of the Ji Realm
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,my original body is stuck at peak Core Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.01,0:09:46.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,If I want to reach Soul Formation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:49.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,I must dissociate the cultivations of the two bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.80,0:09:52.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Before I reach a higher level of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.24,0:09:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,my bodies can only be merged temporarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.09,0:09:57.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,In that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,the two bodies will cultivate separately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.84,0:10:02.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,The original body will cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.61,0:10:04.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,to reach the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.41,0:10:05.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,as a body cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.97,0:10:08.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,by following the path of the Ancient Gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.05,0:10:11.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,To follow the path of the Ancient Gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.09,0:10:13.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I first need to shatter my cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:15.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.68,0:10:32.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I fell out of Core Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:35.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Continue !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now's the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.85,0:10:46.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,to extract the Ji !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.45,0:11:06.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Ji Realm has been refined into an artifact.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.20,0:11:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,It has no use for me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.57,0:11:10.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Give me the beads of killing intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.33,0:11:24.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,A body reconstruction...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:28.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,These pills will help !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.05,0:11:56.45,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1535,467)\fad(300,300}Wang Lin's original body\N2-stars Ancient God
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.57,0:12:13.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,Congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.09,0:12:16.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,on completing the second body reconstruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.28,0:12:18.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.40,0:12:21.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,If someone finds out that I cultivate the path of the Ancient Gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:23.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:25.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will sink into the earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,to face the pressure of the planet core.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.53,0:12:30.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The path of the Ancient Gods
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.25,0:12:32.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,is a solitary path.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.85,0:12:33.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,The cultivation path
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.48,0:12:36.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,is also a dangerous one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Soul Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.65,0:12:59.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,Life and Death Domain...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.36,0:13:00.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,Come !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.97,0:13:08.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is it so dark ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.73,0:13:10.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.09,0:13:14.29,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(355,511)\fad(500,300)}Wang Zhuo's reincarnation\NLate stage Foundation Establishment
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.77,0:13:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,I felt my heart shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.57,0:13:14.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now the sky has suddenly changed colors...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.52,0:13:16.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is there something big going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.17,0:13:33.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,Someone is reaching Soul Formation here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.49,0:13:47.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is making a breakthrough here ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.05,0:13:49.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.21,0:13:51.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,But he must be related to Zhao.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,During a Soul Formation breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.68,0:13:56.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,the spiritual energy gathering is not only helpful for cultivators,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,but is also causes the mortals around it to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.60,0:14:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,It benefits everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.13,0:14:04.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,Settle down and meditate.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:06.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,What is cultivating immortality ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.56,0:14:08.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mortals
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.60,0:14:10.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,learn to breathe the spiritual energy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.52,0:14:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,to transform their bodies for cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is called Foundation Establishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.56,0:14:16.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,After accumulating even more spiritual energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:18.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,they compress it into a Golden Core.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:22.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,As the core gathers more and more energy, it gives birth to the Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.80,0:14:24.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,After reaching Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:28.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,one qualifies to fight against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.32,0:14:31.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,But in order to find a way to fight against the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:33.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,one needs a a domain, a divine weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.80,0:14:37.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,which wields the power of the heaven and earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.96,0:14:40.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,After the Nascent Soul understands the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will become an Origin Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:44.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,that's able to fight against the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.48,0:14:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is how we defy the heavens,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.16,0:14:48.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,by using their own power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.52,0:14:50.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,As long as the Origin Soul lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.08,0:14:52.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,the body is eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:54.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,So he suceeded in Soul Formation...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The realm that Brother Mo mentioned...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.52,0:15:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:30.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a comfortable wind...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.93,0:15:31.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,Look !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.06,Second,,0,0,0,,Is an Immortal passing by ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.71,0:15:44.84,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1532,469)\fad(300,300}Wang Lin's avatar\NEarly stage Soul Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.61,0:15:49.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.64,0:15:51.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you from the country of Zhao ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.28,0:15:54.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you willing to stay here 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.00,0:15:57.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,to allow our country of Zhao to reach rank 4 ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.08,0:15:59.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,To strengthen our nation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.52,0:16:01.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,and resist the invasions of foreigners.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:09.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.04,0:16:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,My meridians seem to have opened up !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,40 years to reach the Late stage of Foundation Establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:22.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,You are ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.12,0:16:29.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you think that carving wood Immortals
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.84,0:16:29.57,Second,,0,0,0,,You are Wang Zhuo
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:31.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,will help you absorb spiritual energy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.33,0:16:32.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Xiuxiu, don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.77,0:16:34.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will acompagny you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:39.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,When you reach Nascent Soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:42.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will remember the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,But if you remember now,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.77,0:16:46.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,it will only
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,bring you pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:52.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can't stay here for 100 years
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:54.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,but I planted spirit seeds
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:56.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,which condensed during my breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.76,0:16:58.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,in the bodies of 10 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.00,0:17:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,Once they reach peak Nascent Soul, I will know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I will personally come to teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.53,0:17:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,This can protect the country of Zhao
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.97,0:17:14.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,from the assault of rank 3 countries 3 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.85,0:17:17.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.36,0:17:18.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.00,0:17:40.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,The sword sheath that was in my bag of holding
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:42.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,should still be in the void here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.61,0:17:56.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.40,0:18:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mere ghost magic treasure,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:17.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,you don’t know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.41,0:18:19.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,From Life to Death
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.65,0:18:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,from Death to Life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.44,0:19:02.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,The movement abilities of Soul Formation level
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,are far more powerful than at Nascent Soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.84,0:19:12.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.64,0:19:14.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.20,0:19:16.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have reached Soul Formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.48,0:19:19.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I reach Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.01,0:19:20.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will be able to wake up Senior Situ.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.73,0:19:22.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe then
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:25.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,there will be a way for me to revive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.09,0:19:29.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.32,0:19:34.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,The way to reach Soul Transformation,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.37,0:19:36.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,besides finding a Soul Transformation Pill,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.48,0:19:39.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,is to use celestial spiritual energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.73,0:19:42.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Celestial Realm is opening soon
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.93,0:19:45.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,and many powerful cultivators are looking forward to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.80,0:19:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,It will definitely be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.01,0:19:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,one hell of a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.57,0:22:23.75,Note,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}In case you didn't catch it, Ceng Niu was the name of Da Niu's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:11.25,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Falling from the night sky and melting into dust\Nlike water without a source.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:17.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Like the difference between clouds and mud,\Nthe truth cannot be found in conflict.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.52,0:20:21.35,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death\Nare like the moment when the rain falls
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:25.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}and like many other unseparable things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.64,0:20:31.29,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}In this lifetime,\Nto cultivate the truth, cultivate the world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:38.30,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Old grudges had to be settled\Nbecause half an inch is engraved into my tree rings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.61,0:20:44.15,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use the most vivid love and hate\Nto ask questions to your fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:48.83,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Let your eyes be filled enough with rage\Nto pierce the heart and the soul
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.09,0:20:52.32,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}then soften because of the mortals' fireworks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.49,0:20:58.31,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Only when you bend down can you understand\Nthe hidden edge of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.83,0:21:02.51,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:06.43,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:12.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.54,0:21:16.21,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.42,0:21:19.99,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:26.03,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.10,0:21:30.11,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}The human mind is nature,\Nthe rain fell silently like an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:33.93,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Life and death are just moments away,\Nthere are many other solutions to grudges.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:39.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Use your dusty heart\Nto depict the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.83,0:21:43.71,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for killing.\NAfter struggling for hundreds of years, I endured letting go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.75,0:21:47.55,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500}One stroke is for caring.\NEverywhere there is life, there are thousands of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.85,0:21:53.41,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Give up your mind to be refined\Nby this endless world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.05,0:22:00.27,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Snow falls as my hair turns white, winter withers\Nwhile prosperity sprouts in summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.57,0:22:07.07,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I step into the world, with light at my fingertips,\Nthe law of cause and effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.09,0:22:13.79,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}I observe the vastness of heaven and earth so I can get rid of evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.96,0:22:20.66,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,300}Obsession arises from one thought, life and death arise from one thought.\NReincarnation is not to be feared.
